/p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eirwen, the Keeper</strong>: the island's last warden, whose old blessings make a frail arm mighty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pryderial, the Wizard</strong>: the court mage who bound the Twelve, and the storm still answers him twice over</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Endless Trial: a roguelike descent under living skies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497320/extras/79e0f89b5159bdf1976dcca1fd749553.avif?t=1793472111\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497320/extras_big/79e0f89b5159bdf1976dcca1fd749553.avif?t=1793472111 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the tale is told, the Trial opens. A self-contained roguelike mode built on the same open d20 and card combat: choose a champion and descend a branching gauntlet of fights, elites, traders and campfires that never ends, only deepens. Forge your deck as you go, hoard run-changing relics, and see how far you can push before the dark takes you back.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A run built one choice at a time</strong>: a procedural route of battles, elites, traders, campfires and treasure. There is always a road; the question is which one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living skies</strong>: every fight rolls its weather, and the weather fights too. Thunderstorms where lightning can strike either side, mist that blinds you both, gales that steal the force from every blow, blood moons that embolden the enemy, starlight that mends you. Day on the early rows, dusk past halfway, night for the boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relics that reshape a run</strong>: dozens of permanent boons that stack into builds no two runs repeat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ten champions</strong>: start with three and unlock the rest by clearing acts, each a different way to win.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ascension</strong>: clear an act and dare the next difficulty tier. Harder, never cheaper.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Daily Trial</strong>: one seed, one champion, one sky, the same run for everyone in the world that day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score and Steam Leaderboards</strong>: an overall board, a board per champion, and the rolling Daily. How high can you climb?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A tale worth reading twice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is carried by a narrator in a storybook voice, and the whole novel lives inside the game. Open the Chronicle from the title screen and read it, cover to cover, whenever you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497320/extras/000d1b22956b88d0a56d4741f11381d9.avif?t=1793472111\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497320/extras_big/000d1b22956b88d0a56d4741f11381d9.avif?t=1793472111 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One illustrated cutaway world, start to finish, in an ink-and-flat-colour storybook style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open, transparent d20 and card combat, with the die rolled on the field and no hidden rolls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >116 cards, each with its own illustration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A buildable class deck for all six heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching journey where choices matter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Endless Trial: a roguelike mode with ten kinds of weather, relics, Ascension tiers, a Daily challenge and leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrated throughout, with the full novel readable in-game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three difficulties, from a gentle read to the hardest road</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements, Leaderboards, Cloud saves and Trading Cards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
